## 图片加载优化策略

### 渐进式图片加载（LQIP）

LQIP（Low Quality Image Placeholder）先显示极小的模糊缩略图，再渐进切换到完整图片：

```tsx
import { useState } from 'react';

interface ProgressiveImageProps {
  src: string;
  placeholder: string;
  alt: string;
  width: number;
  height: number;
}

function ProgressiveImage({ src, placeholder, alt, width, height }: ProgressiveImageProps) {
  const [isLoaded, setIsLoaded] = useState(false);

  return (
    <div style={{ position: 'relative', width, height, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
      <img
        src={placeholder}
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        style={{
          position: 'absolute',
          inset: 0,
          width: '100%',
          height: '100%',
          objectFit: 'cover',
          filter: 'blur(20px)',
          transform: 'scale(1.1)',
          opacity: isLoaded ? 0 : 1,
          transition: 'opacity 0.5s ease',
        }}
      />
      <img
        src={src}
        alt={alt}
        width={width}
        height={height}
        loading="lazy"
        onLoad={() => setIsLoaded(true)}
        style={{
          width: '100%',
          height: '100%',
          objectFit: 'cover',
          opacity: isLoaded ? 1 : 0,
          transition: 'opacity 0.5s ease',
        }}
      />
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 防止 CLS 的图片布局

```css
.image-container {
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  width: 100%;
  background-color: #e0e0e0;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.image-container img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}
```

